---
layout: layouts/studio.html
title: A Better Website & More Customer Enquiries | GoldChest
description: Tell GoldChest about your website and business goals. Start a focused conversation about a new website,a redesign or reaching more customers.
permalink: /start-a-project/index.html
---
<section class="shell page-hero enquiry-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Your next step, made clearer</p>
  <h1>How may we assist your business?</h1>
  <p>A new website, a redesign or more customers. Start with your goal, we'll help you get there.</p>
  <p class="enquiry-note">Working with businesses internationally.</p>
  <a class="button" href="#website-enquiry">Start my brief <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
</section>

<section class="light-section">
  <div class="shell enquiry-layout">
    <aside class="enquiry-expectations" aria-labelledby="next-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">A conversation, not a commitment</p>
      <h2 id="next-heading">You bring the goal.<br>We help with the plan.</h2>
      <ol class="enquiry-steps">
        <li><strong>Tell us a little.</strong>
          <p>Where you are now, what isn't working and what you want to achieve.</p>
        </li>
        <li><strong>We review your brief.</strong>
          <p>We'll look at your goals and any website you share, then get back to you as soon as possible.</p>
        </li>
        <li><strong>Agree a useful next step.</strong>
          <p>We'll clarify the scope together before discussing a proposal. A call is optional.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p>A few sentences in your own words are enough.</p>
      <div class="enquiry-proof">
        <h3>A few businesses we've worked with</h3>
        <ul>{% for client in clients %}<li>{{ client.name | escape }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <form class="enquiry-form" id="website-enquiry" name="website-enquiry" method="POST" action="/enquiry-received/"
      data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" aria-labelledby="brief-heading">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="website-enquiry">
      <p hidden><label>Leave this field empty <input name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></p>
      <h2 id="brief-heading">Tell us what you have in mind.</h2>
      <p class="enquiry-note">Fields marked * are required.</p>
      <fieldset class="enquiry-goals">
        <legend>What is your main goal? *</legend>
        <label><input type="radio" name="goal" value="New website" required><span><strong>I need a new
              website</strong><small>A professional home for my business online.</small></span></label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="goal" value="Website redesign" required><span><strong>My website needs a
              redesign</strong><small>Make what I already have look and work better.</small></span></label>
        <label><input type="radio" name="goal" value="More customer enquiries" required><span><strong>I want to reach
              more customers</strong><small>Help the right people find me and take the next step.</small></span></label>
      </fieldset>
      <label for="enquiry-business">Business / Brand name *</label>
      <input id="enquiry-business" name="business" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="160" required>
      <label for="enquiry-website">Website or social profile <span>(optional)</span></label>
      <input id="enquiry-website" name="website" type="text" inputmode="url" maxlength="500"
        placeholder="example.com or your social profile" aria-describedby="website-hint">
      <p class="enquiry-note" id="website-hint">No website yet? Leave this blank.</p>
      <label for="enquiry-details">What would you like to improve? *</label>
      <textarea id="enquiry-details" name="details" rows="4" maxlength="3000" required
        aria-describedby="details-hint"></textarea>
      <p class="enquiry-note" id="details-hint">Tell us what you do, who your customers are and the result you’re hoping
        for. Please don't include passwords or sensitive customer information.</p>
      <div class="enquiry-fields">
        <div><label for="enquiry-name">Your name *</label><input id="enquiry-name" name="name" autocomplete="name"
            maxlength="120" required></div>
        <div><label for="enquiry-email">Email address *</label><input id="enquiry-email" name="email" type="email"
            autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required></div>
      </div>
      <details class="enquiry-extra">
        <summary>Add Timing or budget (optional)</summary>
        <label for="enquiry-timing">When would you like to get started?</label>
        <select id="enquiry-timing" name="timing">
          <option value="">Select if you know</option>
          <option>As soon as possible</option>
          <option>Within 1-3 months</option>
          <option>Later this year</option>
          <option>Just exploring</option>
        </select>
        <label for="enquiry-budget">Budget range, if you have one</label>
        <input id="enquiry-budget" name="budget" maxlength="120" aria-describedby="budget-hint">
        <p class="enquiry-note" id="budget-hint">Include your currency. It’s fine if you haven’t decided yet.</p>
      </details>
      <p class="enquiry-note">We'll use these details to respond to your enquiry and discuss your project. This form
        does not sign you up for marketing emails. <a href="/privacy/#project-enquiries">How we handle your
          information</a>.</p>
      <p id="enquiry-error" class="enquiry-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
      <button class="button button-dark" type="submit">Send my project brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
      <p class="enquiry-note">Prefer to talk? <a href="tel:+233207615706">Call +233 20 761 5706</a>.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="/js/enquiry.js" defer></script>